---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="案例"
  description="Vibe Coding 真实案例：保留问题背景、协作过程、关键迭代与验证证据。"
>
  <section class="cases-page site-shell">
    <header class="cases-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Case files</p>
      <h1>真实案例，<br /><em>即将入场。</em></h1>
      <p>这个位置留给你提供的案例。材料到位后，我们会把一次真实协作拆开来看，不只展示结果，也保留过程与证据。</p>
    </header>

    <section class="case-placeholder" aria-labelledby="case-placeholder-title">
      <div class="case-number" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>CASE</span>
        <strong>00</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="case-content">
        <p class="case-status"><span></span> Reserved / 待补充</p>
        <h2 id="case-placeholder-title">第一个案例的位置已经留好。</h2>
        <p class="case-deck">收到案例材料后，这里会按照同一套结构整理，让读者能够看见 Agent 如何参与、哪里发生转折，以及什么证据证明结果可信。</p>

        <ol aria-label="案例内容结构">
          <li>
            <span>01</span>
            <strong>原始任务</strong>
            <small>问题、目标与边界</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>02</span>
            <strong>协作过程</strong>
            <small>输入、计划与分工</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>03</span>
            <strong>关键迭代</strong>
            <small>失败、判断与修正</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>04</span>
            <strong>验证证据</strong>
            <small>测试、截图与结果</small>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .cases-page {
    padding-block: 5rem;
  }

  .cases-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .7fr 2fr 1fr;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .cases-header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font: 760 clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 7rem)/.94 var(--serif);
    letter-spacing: -.055em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .cases-header h1 em {
    color: var(--red);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .cases-header > p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .case-placeholder {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, .65fr) 2fr;
    min-height: 520px;
    margin-top: 4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 49.9%, var(--soft-line) 50%, transparent 50.1%) 0 0/32px 100%,
      rgba(255,255,255,.2);
    box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 rgba(201,66,44,.18);
  }

  .case-number {
    display: grid;
    align-content: space-between;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .case-number span {
    font: 700 .76rem/1 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: .14em;
  }

  .case-number strong {
    color: var(--red);
    font: 760 clamp(7rem, 15vw, 13rem)/.7 var(--serif);
    letter-spacing: -.09em;
  }

  .case-content {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .case-status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .65rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    color: var(--red-dark);
    font: 700 .76rem/1 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .case-status span {
    width: .65rem;
    height: .65rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--red);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(201,66,44,.12);
  }

  .case-content h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0;
    font: 730 clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4.7rem)/1.02 var(--serif);
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .case-deck {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 3rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  .case-content ol {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--ink);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .case-content li {
    display: grid;
    min-height: 140px;
    align-content: space-between;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .case-content li span,
  .case-content li small {
    color: var(--muted);
    font: .7rem/1.4 var(--mono);
  }

  .case-content li span {
    color: var(--red-dark);
  }

  .case-content li strong {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.12rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .cases-header {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .cases-header .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .case-placeholder {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .case-number {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: end;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    }

    .case-number strong {
      font-size: 5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .cases-page {
      padding-block: 3rem;
    }

    .cases-header {
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .case-placeholder {
      min-height: 0;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 rgba(201,66,44,.18);
    }

    .case-content {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .case-deck {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .case-content ol {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .case-content li {
      min-height: 125px;
    }
  }
</style>
